@startuml D08_stm_strategy
!include _style.iuml
title D08 State machine: per-product strategy (SPEC 6.5)
[*] --> NoFV
NoFV --> Armed : V(fv, edge)
Armed --> FiredDedup : best ask <= fv - edge / BUY @ask\nor best bid >= fv + edge / SELL @bid\n(last_*_px := price, even if risk rejects)
FiredDedup --> FiredDedup : same best price\n/ no order
FiredDedup --> Armed : best price moves
FiredDedup --> Armed : V (new fv) / last_*_px := NONE
Armed --> LockedOut : ts + LOCKOUT_MS >= gc_ts\nor kill or !strat_en or state != OPEN
FiredDedup --> LockedOut : idem
LockedOut --> Armed : kill cleared / HALT -> OPEN
Armed --> NoFV : S(PREOPEN)
FiredDedup --> NoFV : S(PREOPEN)
LockedOut --> NoFV : S(PREOPEN)
@enduml
